    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 \u2014 Workflows are not straight lines\n\nThe IF node splits the path. **true** leaves the top output, **false** leaves the bottom one.\n\nRun it once as-is. Then open *An order arrives*, change `total` to `50`, and run again. Watch which branch lights up.\n\n**Ask the room:** this workflow has two paths and already needs a second row. Real ones have fifteen. How do you show a customer which path their data took \u2014 without drawing the whole map?\n\nThat question is the canvas screen in the final project.",
